## HarmonyOS / ArkTS gotchas

- **Decorator order matters**: `@Entry @Component struct Foo` — switching the order changes lifecycle binding.
- **`@State` value vs reference**: object mutations (push to array, set property on struct) don't auto-refresh — use immutable replacement (`arr = [...arr, x]`).
- **Ability lifecycle**: `onWindowStageCreate` runs once per ability; UI state lives in `Component` not `Ability` for hot-restart safety.
- **hvigorw vs Gradle**: similar wrapper pattern but different module graph — refer to `oh-package.json5` for dependencies, not `build.gradle`.
- **`oh_modules/`**: package install directory, treat like `node_modules/` (gitignore).

